{"id":"n62589-1-19","stage":1,"title":"돌 · 石","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62589-1-19-1","ko":"누가 창문을 깬 거야?","zh":"是谁打碎窗户的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"창문을","meaning":"窗，窗户","explanation":"창문：窗，窗户；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"창문","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71809","senseId":"1","lemma":"창문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"창문을","audio":"/audio/7c25284c1cbad752179c.mp3"}},{"text":"깬","meaning":"打碎，砸，毁","explanation":"깨다：打碎，砸，毁；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"깨다","audio":"/audio/f06d1a21bd6ecee5f09d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63406","senseId":"1","lemma":"깨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깬","audio":"/audio/e83e061e9891cdd0d818.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，把前面的修饰内容概括为事物、行为或情况。这里不表示指示代词“那个”；具体的时态、疑问或推测语气结合前后的语尾理解。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁，某某，有人","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指无须透露姓名的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"13938495269cab67","term":"창문","zh":"窗，窗户","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3","entryId":"71809","definition":"做在墙壁或屋顶上的、用来通风或采光的门。","pronunciation":["창문"]},{"id":"f06d1a21bd6ecee5","term":"깨다","zh":"打碎，砸，毁","audio":"/audio/f06d1a21bd6ecee5f09d.mp3","entryId":"63406","definition":"打击坚硬的物体，使之成为碎片。","pronunciation":["깨다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/3dd8f1379aa9af228809.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62589-1-19-2","ko":"몰라, 누가 유리창에 돌을 던졌나 봐.","zh":"不知道，好像是有人往玻璃窗上扔石头。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몰라,","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰라","audio":"/audio/8884d387268b95cb0579.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"유리창에","meaning":"玻璃窗","explanation":"유리창：玻璃窗；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"유리창","audio":"/audio/5678a5702e7656e22155.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70467","senseId":"1","lemma":"유리창","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유리창에","audio":"/audio/35ff234bf2d9bbb42627.mp3"}},{"text":"돌을","meaning":"石，石头","explanation":"돌：石，石头；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돌","audio":"/audio/c7e6ac93ca8c5b84f5c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62589","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌을","audio":"/audio/878b175ccf4f946a7637.mp3"}},{"text":"던졌나","meaning":"投，掷，扔","explanation":"던지다：投，掷，扔；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"던지다","audio":"/audio/8d394e0764a0b3692cf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66324","senseId":"1","lemma":"던지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":